Units of Measure (UoM): Must support unit conversions (e.g., Box = 12 pieces, Bag = 5 Kg) to calculate financial balance accurately.

Images: Items are photographed. Images MUST be stored, linked to items, and displayed in the final Excel file. Missing images in the UI/Export is a fundamental bug to fix.

